[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4459691077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117902#issuecomment-4459691077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117902","id":4459691077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCdF8RQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-15T12:20:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T12:20:13Z","body":"I think (hope) I already gave you that feedback on RC. But I guess I'll put it here as well to have it accessible.\r\n\r\nIn general the architecture is good. However the specific implementation requires exposing the builtin implementations of `get_argument_options` which I want to avoid, to prevent compat hell.\r\n\r\nWe should add an additional internal hashmap specifically for `get_argument_options` which holds relevant method pointers without exposing them.\r\n\r\nIf the core team thinks that's out of scope for `ClassDB` we can introduce an additional singleton for it I guess. But I feel `ClassDB` is good enough a place for it, since I'm not convinced, that we want to get rid of the coupling in this specific case. (Placing the handling of argument options in its dedicated place in autocompletion code, muddies the water on code ownership and will make it harder to keep the stuff up-to date.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4459691077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5145859026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117902#issuecomment-5145859026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117902","id":5145859026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMreT0g","user":{"login":"developpeur2000","id":16148710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ4NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16148710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000","html_url":"https://github.com/developpeur2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developpeur2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-31T17:46:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T17:46:31Z","body":"Hey @HolonPr