:"2026-10-12T16:45:43Z","body":"I did bring this up during the last core meeting. And we seem to have consensus on that it's fine to put the registration logic into `core`, especially since in the future there might be a way to have static virtuals through `GDType`. We'd like to put it outside of `ClassDB` for now though.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6128610563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]